   "text": "for file in swiftFiles(repo):\n  for occ in db.symbolOccurrences(file):\n    Scip_Occurrence + SymbolInformation\n  \u2192 Scip_Document  (sorted, rel. path)\n\u2192 Scip_Index\n  + external_symbols",
   "originalText": "for file in swiftFiles(repo):\n  for occ in db.symbolOccurrences(file):\n    Scip_Occurrence + SymbolInformation\n  \u2192 Scip_Document  (sorted, rel. path)\n\u2192 Scip_Index\n  + external_symbols",
